{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>ברגע [for a moment].</b> The bet in רגע is superfluous, like the bet in תחילה, בראשון. Some interpret it as from רוגע הים [the sea's surging] (Isaiah 51:15), and the proof is וברחמים [and with compassion]."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 54, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:59:28.390782275Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}